<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Git on Ricky</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/categories/git/</link><description>Recent content in Git on Ricky</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 07 Mar 2025 15:46:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://linzeyan.github.io/categories/git/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>How Core Git Developers Configure Git</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2025/20250307-how-git-core-devs-configure-git/</link><pubDate>Fri, 07 Mar 2025 15:46:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2025/20250307-how-git-core-devs-configure-git/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.gitbutler.com/how-git-core-devs-configure-git/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;How Core Git Developers Configure Git&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-f3bd21b132f11d32e213074f9e817cd2-0"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# clearly makes git better&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;column&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;ui&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; auto
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;branch&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;sort&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; -committerdate
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;tag&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;sort&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; version:refname
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;init&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;defaultBranch&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; main
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;diff&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;algorithm&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; histogram
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;colorMoved&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; plain
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;mnemonicPrefix&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;renames&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;push&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;default&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; simple
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;autoSetupRemote&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;followTags&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;fetch&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;prune&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;pruneTags&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;all&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# why the hell not?&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;help&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;autocorrect&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; prompt
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;commit&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;verbose&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;rerere&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;enabled&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;autoupdate&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;core&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;excludesfile&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; ~/.gitignore
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;rebase&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;autoSquash&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;autoStash&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;updateRefs&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# a matter of taste (uncomment if you dare)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;core&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# fsmonitor = true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# untrackedCache = true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;merge&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# (just &amp;#39;diff3&amp;#39; if git version &amp;lt; 2.3)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# conflictstyle = zdiff3&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;pull&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# rebase = true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"# clearly makes git better\n\n[column]\n ui = auto\n[branch]\n sort = -committerdate\n[tag]\n sort = version:refname\n[init]\n defaultBranch = main\n[diff]\n algorithm = histogram\n colorMoved = plain\n mnemonicPrefix = true\n renames = true\n[push]\n default = simple\n autoSetupRemote = true\n followTags = true\n[fetch]\n prune = true\n pruneTags = true\n all = true\n\n# why the hell not?\n\n[help]\n autocorrect = prompt\n[commit]\n verbose = true\n[rerere]\n enabled = true\n autoupdate = true\n[core]\n excludesfile = ~/.gitignore\n[rebase]\n autoSquash = true\n autoStash = true\n updateRefs = true\n\n# a matter of taste (uncomment if you dare)\n\n[core]\n # fsmonitor = true\n # untrackedCache = true\n[merge]\n # (just 'diff3' if git version \u003c 2.3)\n # conflictstyle = zdiff3\n[pull]\n # rebase = true\n","title":"bash"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>How I configure my Git identities</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2024/20241125-git-config/</link><pubDate>Mon, 25 Nov 2024 17:35:35 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2024/20241125-git-config/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.benji.dog/articles/git-config/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;How I configure my Git identities&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;includeIf&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-11ea58409a8a823fb06ab5d3af6fb51f-0"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;[includeIf &amp;#34;gitdir:~/code/**&amp;#34;]
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; path = ~/.config/git/personal
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;[includeIf &amp;#34;gitdir:~/work/**&amp;#34;]
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; path = ~/.config/git/work
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"[includeIf \"gitdir:~/code/**\"]\n path = ~/.config/git/personal\n[includeIf \"gitdir:~/work/**\"]\n path = ~/.config/git/work\n","title":"Code"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;hasconfig:remote.*.url:&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-11ea58409a8a823fb06ab5d3af6fb51f-1"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;[includeIf &amp;#34;hasconfig:remote.*.url:git@github.com:*/**&amp;#34;]
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; path = ~/.config/git/config-gh
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;[includeIf &amp;#34;hasconfig:remote.*.url:git@github.com:orgname/**&amp;#34;]
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; path = ~/.config/git/config-gh-org
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;[includeIf &amp;#34;hasconfig:remote.*.url:git@gitlab.com:*/**&amp;#34;]
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; path = ~/.config/git/config-gl
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;[includeIf &amp;#34;hasconfig:remote.*.url:git@git.sr.ht:*/**&amp;#34;]
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; path = ~/.config/git/config-srht
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"[includeIf \"hasconfig:remote.*.url:git@github.com:*/**\"]\n path = ~/.config/git/config-gh\n[includeIf \"hasconfig:remote.*.url:git@github.com:orgname/**\"]\n path = ~/.config/git/config-gh-org\n[includeIf \"hasconfig:remote.*.url:git@gitlab.com:*/**\"]\n path = ~/.config/git/config-gl\n[includeIf \"hasconfig:remote.*.url:git@git.sr.ht:*/**\"]\n path = ~/.config/git/config-srht\n","title":"Code"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;insteadOf&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Git force push</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2024/20240726-git/</link><pubDate>Fri, 26 Jul 2024 12:24:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2024/20240726-git/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jvt.me/posts/2021/10/23/undo-force-push/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://www.jvt.me/posts/2021/10/23/undo-force-push/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jvt.me/posts/2018/09/18/safely-force-git-push/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://www.jvt.me/posts/2018/09/18/safely-force-git-push/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-180bc880ad286f0371e2220741e5b903-0"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git push --force-with-lease
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"git push --force-with-lease\n","title":"bash"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Tracking SQLite Database Changes in Git</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2024/20240207-tracking_sqlite_database_changes_git/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 Feb 2024 19:20:15 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2024/20240207-tracking_sqlite_database_changes_git/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://lobste.rs/s/gnv9ho/tracking_sqlite_database_changes_git" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Tracking SQLite Database Changes in Git&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://stackoverflow.com/a/21789167" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Git hook for diff sqlite table&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;First, add a diff type called &amp;ldquo;sqlite3&amp;rdquo; to your config. The simplest way is to just run these commands:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-4629d4c1aa4e786eb0931af1b370507f-0"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git config diff.sqlite3.binary &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt; git config diff.sqlite3.textconv &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;echo .dump | sqlite3&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"git config diff.sqlite3.binary true git config diff.sqlite3.textconv \"echo .dump | sqlite3\"\n","title":"shell"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Alternatively, you can add this snippet to your &lt;code&gt;~/.gitconfig&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;.git/config&lt;/code&gt; in your repository:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Sign git commits with GPG</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2021/20211005-sign_git_commit_with_gpg/</link><pubDate>Tue, 05 Oct 2021 18:28:06 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2021/20211005-sign_git_commit_with_gpg/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.puckwang.com/posts/2019/sign_git_commit_with_gpg/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Sign git commits with GPG&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>Little Git Tricks: Use .mailmap to Merge Different Authors</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2021/20210805-little-git-tricks-use-mailmap-to-merge-different-authors/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Aug 2021 13:42:14 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2021/20210805-little-git-tricks-use-mailmap-to-merge-different-authors/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://improveandrepeat.com/2019/06/little-git-tricks-use-mailmap-to-merge-different-authors/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Little Git Tricks: Use .mailmap to Merge Different Authors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;.mailmap&lt;/code&gt; file ==&amp;gt; &lt;code&gt;Name you want to keep &amp;lt;email&amp;gt; Name you no longer want &amp;lt;email&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-3260c81c1c75439393632a637cd61fab-0"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;John Doe John Doe
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;John Doe John Doe
